    "chunk_text": "Her ongyn\u00f0 seo boc, \u00f0e is genemned on Ebreisc Valedaber, \u00f0\u00e6t is on Leden Numerus, and on Englisc DRIHTEN spr\u00e6c witodlice to Moyse on Sinai dune, on \u00f0\u00e6re halgan stowe, on \u00f0am forman d\u00e6ge \u00f0\u00e6s Nim & telle Israhela folc, swa hw\u00e6t swa w\u00e6pnedhades sy: Fram twentigum wintrum & ofer \u00f0\u00e6t, ealle & \u00f0\u00e6ra m\u00e6g\u00f0a ealdras beo\u00f0 mid inc mid heora hiredum, \u00f0e \u00f0is synd heora naman: of Rubene, Elisur, Of Simeon, Salamiel Surisaddais sunu. Of Iuda, Naason Aminadabis sunu; of Isachar, Nathanael Suares sunu; of Zabulon, Eliab Elonis sunu; \u00d0is synd \u00f0a, \u00f0e w\u00e6ron \u00f0a \u00e6\u00f0elostan ealdras geond \u00f0a scira, & Israhela heafodmenn. Moyses & Aaron gegaderodon ealle \u00f0as on \u00f0am forman d\u00e6ge \u00f0\u00e6s \u00e6ftran mon\u00f0es, & demdon him, \u00d0us fela w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6ra manna, \u00f0e Moyses & Aaron & \u00f0a xii Israhela ealdras getealdon fram twentigum \u00dea sacerdas mid heora hirede n\u00e6ron getealde mid him, for \u00f0an \u00f0e Drihten bebead Moyse: Ne telle \u00f0u Israhela bearn dydon neah eallon \u00f0ingon \u00fee Drihten bebead \u00f0urh Moysen. & EALLES heora heres w\u00e6s, \u00f0a he tod\u00e6led w\u00e6s, fifhund \u00f0usenda & \u00fereo & hundeahtatig \u00f0usenda & Hig foron flocm\u00e6lum mid heora hiredum. \u00d0IS synd Aarones bearna naman, \u00fee to sacerdum gehalgode w\u00e6ron",
